  "title": "咖啡師：喂！今日想食啲咩呀？",
  "content_type": "paragraph",
  "content_text": "咖啡師：喂！今日想食啲咩呀？\n[Barista: Hey! What can I get you today?]\nLeo：喂！請問可以畀我一杯冰燕麥拿鐵嗎？仲可以加個糕點之類嘅——你有咩推介呀？\n[Leo: Hi! Can I get an iced oat latte, please? And maybe a pastry or something — what do you recommend?]\n咖啡師：香蕉松餅真係好多人買呀，就係十幾分鐘前出嚟嘅。\n[Barista: The banana muffin is really popular. It just came out of the oven like ten minutes ago.]\nLeo：哦，賣咗！我都要買一個。\n[Leo: Oh, sold! I'll take one of those too.]\n咖啡師：好啲選擇呀。係喺度飲定係帶走呀？\n[Barista: Nice choice. For here or to go?]\nLeo：畀你啦。我打算喺度露營幾陣——有啲工作要搞。\n[Leo: For here. I'm gonna camp out for a bit — got some work to do.]\n咖啡師：唔使擔心，我哋有免費Wi-Fi。密碼喺你身後嘅牆上。哦，如果你要充電，插頭喺長凳底度。\n[Barista: No worries, we've got free Wi-Fi. Password's on the wall behind you. Oh, and plug's under the bench if you need to charge.]\nLeo：好正，多謝。順帶一提，呢度平時都係咁涼快呀？\n[Leo: Awesome, thanks. By the way, is it always this chill here?]\n咖啡師：幾似呀！朝早都靜靜嘅，到咗中午就開始忙啲。你應該揀個靠窗邊嘅位——光線最好，人又少啲。\n[Barista: Pretty much! Mornings are quiet, it picks up around noon. You should grab a spot near the window — best light and less foot traffic.]\nLeo：好貼士呀，我會咁做嘅。你喺度搵緊幾耐呀？\n[Leo: Good tip. I'll do that. How long have you been working here?]\n咖啡師：大約六個月啦。我係從悉尼搬嚟嘅——真係受不了咗冬天。\n[Barista: About six months. I moved here from Sydney — couldn't stand the winter anymore.]\nLeo：呀，我明白啦。其實我諗住喺度住幾個月先。\n[Leo: Ha, I get that. I'm thinking about basing myself here for a couple months actually.]\n咖啡師：老兄，做啦！好多遙距工作嘅人會嚟呢度，你一定會融入得好啲。\n[Barista: Dude, do it. A lot of remoters come through here. You'll fit right in.]",
